{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415761","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415761","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1041576101:1":{"text":"恕我失礼，阁下，你的内心中是否也有着关于生死的执念？","source_cn":"恕我失礼，阁下，你的内心中是否也有着关于生死的执念？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x415B1F4334AE31BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041576102:1":{"text":"为何这么问？","source_cn":"为何这么问？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89507CC947B0CD41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041576103:1":{"text":"我能看出来……你的眼神中有着与我相似的执着。或者说，与曾经的我很相似。","source_cn":"我能看出来……你的眼神中有着与我相似的执着。或者说，与...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62115F5D2F9A961D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041576104:0":{"text":"我曾对自己的“生命”不屑一顾，在漫长的永生中寻找着真正的解脱。直到不久前，我意外找到了“活下去”的理由。","source_cn":"我曾对自己的“生命”不屑一顾，在漫长的永生中寻找着真正...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8D1981E59524035","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041576105:1":{"text":"……这样啊。","source_cn":"……这样啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B1456F7866F4F31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041576106:0":{"text":"不，我们不一样。","source_cn":"不，我们不一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFF1BFFB9ED0D697","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041576107:1":{"text":"你执着于自己的“死”，而我在试着寻回那冰冷的海水中，唯一能让我温暖的生命。","source_cn":"你执着于自己的“死”，而我在试着寻回那冰冷的海水中，唯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95D14BDE2F20A8CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041576108:1":{"text":"如此看来，你的执念是关于他人的。","source_cn":"如此看来，你的执念是关于他人的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x440F0D6B376E1FFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041576109:1":{"text":"我的妻子。但她的离去是暂时的，而我……一定会将她复活。","source_cn":"我的妻子。但她的离去是暂时的，而我……一定会将她复活。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79E4B60EAE2DBC1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041576110:1":{"text":"你想让她也成为亡灵？","source_cn":"你想让她也成为亡灵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98C692F6DE1E5C7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041576111:1":{"text":"亡灵……不，她如此美好，不该在漫长的时间中变得浑浑噩噩，我要让她以最鲜活的模样回到我身边。","source_cn":"亡灵……不，她如此美好，不该在漫长的时间中变得浑浑噩噩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh